to worry about me.",9,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_160","Especially you, ==PLAYER_NAME==. You've been worrying about me, haven't you?",9,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_160","You haven't even gotten your own memories back, yet here you are, bending over backwards to make sure I'm okay.",9,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_160","How do I ever repay that kind of kindness? As a Trekker Association employee, my hands are somewhat tied... But even so...",9,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_160","I want to be your strength. To be someone you can always count on.",9,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_160","To think you managed to sway a heart that only ever cared about work.==W== You are incredible, ==PLAYER_NAME==.",9,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["bgm",""],["w",1.0],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.75],["w",0.75],["fx",0,"fx_avg_watermarks_lp",1,0],["bg","beach_wasteland_daylight",0,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"stop"],["cbg",0,-200.0,-100.0,1.25,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"stop"],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,null,null,1.3,"OutQuad",0.75,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.75],["w",1.25],["se","se_451"],["show","avg1_160","b","021",0.55,-0.1,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_160","b",null,null,0.5,0.0,null,1.0,"lengzhan","OutBack",0.65],["w",1.15],["ctl","avg1_160","b","015","sigh",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_160","Phew...",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"v","007","exclamation","lengzhan"],["say","avg3_100","Willow! You were down there forever. I was starting to worry...",1,""],["mrt",3,"v",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm","m57"],["ctl","avg1_160","b","005",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_160","Haha, relax! That's nothing for an experienced diver.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_160","b","007",null,null,-0.25,1.3,null,"diantou","OutQuad",0.5],["say","avg1_160","==PLAYER_NAME==...==W== Can I ask a favor?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_160","b","006","shy",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"v","012","quest